How to read the results
  200 = page served OK   403 = refused by a security rule (WAF / bucket policy / ALB)
  000 = no answer at all (a firewall dropped the connection)   ping FAIL = no network path
  ❌ next to Expected means we WANT it to be blocked – a block is a PASS.
  Commands are shortened for reading; the exact code is in scripts/demo-tests.sh.
